# VRAM protection for the window in front (dmemcg-booster and plasma-foreground-booster), decided at every boot.
#   auto      (default) on whenever any GPU has registered VRAM with the dmem cgroup controller
#   amd-dgpu  on only for amdgpu with its own VRAM registered with the dmem controller
#   yes       same as auto, kept for existing configurations
#   no        off
# The decision and its reason are in /run/sparky-stereo-vram-boost/state and in the journal
# (journalctl -u sparky-stereo-vram-boost). A new value counts from the next boot.
SPARKY_STEREO_VRAM_BOOST=auto
